			<signature>func get_debug_snapshot() -&gt; Dictionary:</signature>
			<description>获取取消状态快照。</description>
			<tags>
				<tag name="api">public</tag>
				<tag name="return">取消状态快照。</tag>
				<tag name="schema">return: Dictionary，包含 cancelled、reason、metadata 和 cancelled_msec。</tag>
